# The relaxation on 4 workers: a row of 8 tiles holding 1 to 8, until the largest change
# of a round is under 0.4 (400 thousandths), at most 20 rounds.
# Look for: the rounds made (the control program's result), and the tensors after them.
options workers 4
tensor a f32 4 32 fill tile+1
tensor b f32 4 32
tensor worst f32 4 4
control settle a b worst 400:u32 20:u32
read a
read b
read worst
